1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Every great institution begins with a vision.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:09,700
A vision to advance healthcare,
restore hope, and serve generations.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,400
In Penang, Al Aafiyah Group envisions AMIR —

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:20,800
a landmark specialist hospital shaped by innovation,
compassion, and enduring Islamic values.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,200
Designed around the patient journey,

6
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:31,400
every arrival, every interaction, and every space
reflects dignity, comfort, and care.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,300
From specialist consultations
to dialysis and coordinated kidney care,

8
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:43,800
AMIR brings essential services together
in one integrated environment.

9
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,500
Purpose-designed clinical environments support
advanced diagnostics, specialist procedures,

10
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:58,100
critical care, and the pursuit
of excellence in transplantation.

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,800
Beyond treatment, AMIR imagines a healing experience

12
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:11,100
where patients and families find reassurance,
privacy, and meaningful support.

13
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,900
Rooted in Penang, this vision seeks
to establish a lasting foundation

14
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:23,000
for specialist care, partnerships,
and healthier communities.

15
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:28,600
AMIR. Envisioning a healthier tomorrow.
